  "ingredients": [
    "16 ounce cauliflower",
    "1 tablespoon soy sauce",
    "1 tablespoon unseasoned rice vinegar",
    "5 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "5 ounce canned pink salmon",
    "1 tablespoon mayonnaise",
    "2 whole nori sheets"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Trim all of the leaves from the outside of the cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chop the cauliflower into chunks that are small enough to fit into your food processor.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the grater attachment to process all of the cauliflower into rice-like consistency.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast the cauliflower over medium-high heat, until it’s steamed out most of the water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in the tablespoon of soy sauce and the unseasoned rice vinegar.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a mixing bowl and stir in the softened cream cheese until well combined. Chill in the fridge for about half an hour.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the canned salmon with the mayonnaise; set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the rice mixture into sections equal to serving sizes. Place one of the sections onto a sheet of plastic wrap and create a well in the middle.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add a tablespoon of the salmon mixture into the well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the plastic wrap to form a ball of cauliflower rice around the salmon. One the salmon is fully enclosed, create a triangle shape.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Unwrap the rice and adjust the shape as needed. It’s a little bit harder to work with than regular rice, so just be patient and do your best.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut the sheets of nori into thirds. Place the rice into the center of a strip of nori.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold the strips over the rice and wrap around the bottom, almost like a jacket.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/keto-onigiri-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Optionally you can garnish the top with a little flaked salmon to show what’s inside. Repeat with the other sections to complete the number of servings.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-onigiri/#wprm-recipe-52357-step-0-13",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
